<p>Perhaps I went a bit overboard with the (retro) gaming-related stickers. I had more but ran out of space. I realised too late that I was missing a music-related one. The biggest challenge was fixing a few overlapping edges that looked bad, where I had to rip off and redo a part of some stickers. The extra fine nib tip is already getting loose&hellip;</p>
